<li><strong>You will improve future IRKs</strong></li>
</ol>
<p>It’s simple: the fewer of these we have in the warehouse, the less likely they’ll be to end up in the next Instant Regret Kit we sell.</p>
<p>Yes, you still end up with this stuff, but you <em>know</em> you’re going to get it, so your disappointment is tempered. You’re not coming in excited for a surprise, thus making the letdown even more intense.</p>
<p>And if you’re like, “But I don’t even buy the IRKs,” then consider getting this an act of kindness towards those who do.</p>
